      ],
      "supported_codes": [],
      "policy_version": "v1",
      "constants": {
        "min_seats": 1,
        "max_seats": 20,
        "min_days": 1,
        "max_days": 7,
        "cooldown_seconds": 2592000
      },
      "text": "# 临时席位规则 {#policy.temporary_seats}\n临时席位仅允许严格整数 seats=1..20、days=1..7，且订阅必须 active。\n30 日冷却区间为 [last_successful_grant_at,last_successful_grant_at+2592000秒)，等号可以重新申请。\n只读诊断不得创建提案；写入需要当前有效规则、完整事实、合格主管批准且不可自批。",
      "content_sha256": "26f3553369d2b59e1e757a4b5e90b59b2cf0f405f34a5d2a68769638407d2637"
    }
